dports (2.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Add interactive TUI installer using whiptail/dialog
  * Add automatic shell detection (Bash, Fish)
  * Add installation progress dialogs
  * Add filtering options (-p, -n, -i)
  * Add JSON output (-j)
  * Add quiet mode (-q)
  * Add verbose mode showing internal ports (-v)
  * Add color control (-c, -C)
  * Add support for stopped containers (-a)
  * Add Fish shell tab completions
  * Fix IPv6 address parsing
  * Add fallback to simple text menu when whiptail unavailable

